","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"에버턴 sign Ivorian striker Ibrahima Bakayoko from 몽펠리에 for £4.5million.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-547c452372e374fb","date":"1998-10-10","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998_in_association_football#Events","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"연도별 사건 기록","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"프랑크 레이카르트 makes his debut as the manager of the Netherlands national team , as the successor of Guus Hiddink , with a 2–0 friendly win over Peru in Eindhoven . One player makes his debut as well: striker Jeffrey Talan from Heerenveen.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-0c401b5bf2563bd8","date":"1998-10-15","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"Steve Watson , 뉴캐슬 유나이티드's longest serving player (who joined the club on leaving school in 1990), is sold to 애스턴 빌라 for £4.5million.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-916fd95f852654d2","date":"1998-10-25","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"레스터 시티 confirm that manager 마틴 오닐 will not be moving to 리즈 유나이티드. Caretaker 데이비드 오리어리 , formerly assistant manager at Elland Road , gets the manager's job on a permanent basis.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-631666fffb881e20","date":"1998-10-28","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"첼시 player-manager 잔루카 비알리 scores a hat-trick in the 4–1 League Cup third round win over 애스턴 빌라. Making his debut as a late substitute is 17-year-old defender 존 테리 . On the same day, striker 브리안 라우드루프 's departure from 첼시 is announced after just four months at the club.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-f7d790b746104794","date":"1998-10-31","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"Ron Reeves, a 55-year-old steward, is killed outside Highfield Road stadium after being crushed by the 아스널 team coach just before a game with 코번트리 시티. The month ends with 애스턴 빌라 still top, a point ahead of second placed 맨체스터 유나이티드, while 아스널 are close behind in third place. A wide gap is beginning to open up between the top three and the rest of the division, with 리버풀, 미들즈브러, 첼시, 레스터 시티 and 웨스트햄 유나이티드 putting up the nearest competition. 사우샘프턴, still only with one win to their name, occupy bottom place and are joined in the relegation zone by 코번트리 시티 and 노팅엄 포리스트. 선덜랜드 and 허더즈필드 타운 continue to head the race for Premier League football, with the top six being completed by 버밍엄 시티, 입스위치 타운 , 왓퍼드 and 노리치 시티. 그림즈비 타운 (eighth) have emerged as surprise contenders for a second successive promotion, but Bury's challenge is falling away and they now occupy 15th place. 울버햄프턴 원더러스 fare little better after their dismal start to the season, now occupying 12th place.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0}]}